% layout 'default';
% title 'Returns';

<div class="container" style="margin: 60px auto; max-width: 900px;">
    <h1>Returns & Refunds</h1>
    <p style="margin-top: 12px;">
        You can request a return within 7 days of delivery for damaged, defective, or incorrect items.
    </p>
    <p>Products must be returned in original condition with packaging and invoice.</p>
    <p>Refunds are processed after quality check and usually completed within 5-7 business days.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 12px;">To initiate a return, contact support with your order ID and issue details.</p>
</div>
